  "blocks": {
    "\"As a skill — the agent loads it only when the task involves deploys. In AGENTS.md it'd burn tokens on every turn for something we use weekly.\"": "“做成技能——只有任务涉及部署时，智能体才会加载它。如果放在 AGENTS.md 中，为了一份每周才用一次的内容，每个<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/turn\">轮次</a>都会白白消耗 Token。”",
    "\"Where should I put the deploy runbook?\"": "“部署操作手册应该放在哪里？”",
    "A SKILL.md file — metadata (a name and description, at minimum) plus the instructions themselves": "一个 <code>SKILL.md</code> 文件——至少包含名称、描述等元数据，以及技能指令本身",
    "A teachable capability bundled as a unit — instructions and resources for doing one task well, kept in the environment until a context pointer pulls it into the context window for the task at hand. The unit of progressive disclosure in a harness.": "技能是被打包成独立单元、可以传授的能力，其中包含把某一类任务做好所需的指令和资源。它平时保存在<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/environment\">环境</a>中，直到<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context-pointer\">上下文指针</a>根据当前任务把它加载进<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context-window\">上下文窗口</a>。技能是<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/harness\">运行框架</a>实现<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/progressive-disclosure\">渐进式披露</a>的基本单元。",
    "Avoid: \"tool\" — a tool is what the agent calls; a skill is instructions it reads.": "<em>避免：</em>把技能称为“工具”。<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/tool\">工具</a>是智能体调用的函数，技能则是智能体读取的指令。",
    "Only the name and description sit in context by default. When the agent's task matches, it loads the rest. Until then, the skill takes up almost no room — a sentence or two of tokens, however large its full instructions are.": "默认情况下，只有技能名称和描述会进入<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context\">上下文</a>。当智能体的任务与技能匹配时，才会加载其余内容。在此之前，无论完整指令有多长，技能都只占用一两句话的 <a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/token\">Token</a>。",
    "Optionally, scripts the agent can run": "可选：供<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/agent\">智能体</a>运行的脚本",
    "Optionally, templates and reference material the instructions point to": "可选：指令引用的模板和参考资料",
    "Skills are an open standard, defined at agentskills.io — originally developed by Anthropic and since adopted by most major harnesses, so a skill written once works across them. The format is a folder containing:": "技能是一项开放标准，规范发布在 agentskills.io。它最初由 Anthropic 开发，后来被大多数主流运行框架采用，因此一份技能只需编写一次，就能跨不同框架使用。其格式是一个包含以下内容的文件夹：",
    "This distinguishes skills from AGENTS.md, which is loaded into every session regardless of the task. A skill is read when a particular kind of work comes up — releasing, scaffolding a new service, writing a migration — and ignored the rest of the time.": "这正是技能与 <a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/agents-md\">AGENTS.md</a> 的区别：无论任务是什么，AGENTS.md 都会加载进每次<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/session\">会话</a>；技能则只在出现特定类型的工作时才会被读取，例如发布版本、搭建新服务或编写迁移，其余时间不会占用上下文。",
    "Usage:": "<em>用法：</em>"
  },
